</section>

<section data-label="Feedback" data-screen-label="17" data-speaker-notes="Feedback components exist so that nothing on the platform fails silently. Four alert tones, and the important one for you is warning — it sits far enough from brand orange to still read as a caution rather than as branding, which matters when the message is fifteen minutes remaining. The score ring is purpose-built: it knows the pass mark, so it turns green or red on its own rather than making a designer remember to colour it." style="display:flex;flex-direction:column;padding:76px 100px 56px;font-family:Poppins,sans-serif;color:#1a1917;background:#fff">
<h2 style="margin:0 0 16px;font-size:64px;font-weight:700;letter-spacing:-.02em">Feedback</h2>
<p style="margin:0 0 56px;font-size:34px;font-weight:300;line-height:1.5;color:#4e4a43;max-width:58ch">Nothing fails silently. Four alert tones, progress in two forms, and a score ring that knows the pass mark.</p>
<div style="display:flex;flex-direction:column;gap:16px;margin-bottom:36px">
