<section data-label="Navigation" data-screen-label="18" data-speaker-notes="Navigation is where a learner either knows where they are or doesn't. Underline tabs for page-level sections, pill tabs for switching a view inside a card — two different jobs that look similar enough that people reach for the wrong one. Counts on the tabs matter more than they look: telling someone there are forty-two curriculum items before they click is the difference between confident navigation and guessing." style="display:flex;flex-direction:column;padding:76px 100px 56px;font-family:Poppins,sans-serif;color:#1a1917;background:#f9f7f4">
<h2 style="margin:0 0 16px;font-size:64px;font-weight:700;letter-spacing:-.02em">Navigation</h2>
<p style="margin:0 0 56px;font-size:34px;font-weight:300;line-height:1.5;color:#4e4a43;max-width:58ch">Underline tabs for page sections, pill tabs for views inside a card. Counts tell the learner what is behind a tab before they click.</p>
<p style="margin:0 0 36px;display:flex;gap:18px;align-items:center;font-size:28px;color:#6a655c">Certifications<span style="color:#cbc6bd">/</span>AWS<span style="color:#cbc6bd">/</span><span style="color:#1a1917;font-weight:500">Solutions Architect &ndash; Associate</span></p>
<div style="display:flex;gap:56px;border-bottom:3px solid #e2ded7;margin-bottom:48px">
<span style="padding-bottom:22px;font-size:32px;font-weight:600;color:#8a847a">Overview</span>
<span style="padding-bottom:22px;margin-bottom:-3px;border-bottom:5px solid #f0602a;font-size:32px;font-weight:600;display:flex;gap:14px;align-items:baseline">Curriculum<span style="font-size:24px;color:#aca69c">42</span></span>
<span style="padding-bottom:22px;font-size:32px;font-weight:600;color:#8a847a;display:flex;gap:14px;align-items:baseline">Reviews<span style="font-size:24px;color:#aca69c">1,840</span></span>
</div>
