<section data-label="Learning components" data-screen-label="19" data-speaker-notes="These four are the ones that don't exist in a generic component library, and they're the reason this is a Whizlabs system rather than a starter kit. A course card has to hold a vendor, a level, a question count and a price without becoming a wall of text. A lesson row has to show done, current and not-yet at a glance. A stat tile has to make one number the hero. If we got only these four right, the system would still earn its keep." style="display:flex;flex-direction:column;padding:76px 100px 56px;font-family:Poppins,sans-serif;color:#1a1917;background:#fff">
<h2 style="margin:0 0 16px;font-size:64px;font-weight:700;letter-spacing:-.02em">Learning components</h2>
<p style="margin:0 0 56px;font-size:34px;font-weight:300;line-height:1.5;color:#4e4a43;max-width:58ch">The four that make this a Whizlabs system rather than a generic kit — built for courses, curricula and timed exams.</p>
<div style="display:grid;grid-template-columns:1fr 1.4fr;gap:44px;flex:1">
<div style="background:#fff;border:2px solid #efece7;border-radius:14px;box-shadow:0 1px 3px rgba(26,25,23,.08);overflow:hidden;display:flex;flex-direction:column">
<div style="height:150px;background:linear-gradient(135deg,#e8402b,#f0602a 52%,#f78b20);position:relative;display:flex;align-items:flex-end;padding:22px">
<span style="font-size:22px;font-weight:700;letter-spacing:.1em;text-transform:uppercase;color:#fff;background:rgba(26,25,23,.32);padding:8px 16px;border-radius:999px">Practice Test</span>
<span style="position:absolute;top:20px;right:20px;background:#1a1917;color:#fff;font-size:22px;font-weight:600;padding:8px 16px;border-radius:999px">Bestseller</span>
</div>
<div style="padding:22px 28px;display:flex;flex-direction:column;gap:14px;flex:1">
<span style="font-size:22px;font-weight:600;letter-spacing:.1em;text-transform:uppercase;color:#8a847a">AWS</span>
<span style="font-size:30px;font-weight:700;line-height:1.3;letter-spacing:-.01em">Solutions Architect &ndash; Associate (SAA-C03)</span>
<span style="display:flex;gap:12px;flex-wrap:wrap"><span style="display:inline-flex;align-items:center;padding:12px 26px;border-radius:999px;background:#efece7;color:#4e4a43;font-size:26px;font-weight:600;">Associate</span><span style="display:inline-flex;align-items:center;padding:12px 26px;border-radius:999px;background:#efece7;color:#4e4a43;font-size:26px;font-weight:600;">780 questions</span></span>
<span style="margin-top:auto;padding-top:20px;border-top:2px solid #efece7;display:flex;justify-content:space-between;align-items:center;font-size:26px">
<span style="color:#6a655c"><span style="color:#d94b1c;font-weight:700">&#9733; 4.6</span> &middot; 128,400</span><span style="font-size:30px;font-weight:700">$19.95</span></span>
</div>
</div>
<div style="display:flex;flex-direction:column;gap:28px">
<div style="display:grid;grid-template-columns:1fr 1fr;gap:24px">
<div style="background:#fff;border:2px solid #efece7;border-radius:14px;padding:28px;display:flex;gap:20px;align-items:center">
<span class="wl-ico" data-sz="30" style="width:64px;height:64px;border-radius:10px;background:#fff5f0;color:#d94b1c;display:grid;place-items:center;flex:0 0 auto"><i data-lucide="trending-up"></i></span>
<span><span style="display:block;font-size:40px;font-weight:700;letter-spacing:-.02em">82%</span><span style="display:block;font-size:24px;color:#6a655c">Average mock score <span style="color:#0b7a3c;font-weight:600">+6</span></span></span>
</div>
<div style="background:#fff;border:2px solid #efece7;border-radius:14px;padding:28px;display:flex;gap:20px;align-items:center">
<span class="wl-ico" data-sz="30" style="width:64px;height:64px;border-radius:10px;background:#efece7;color:#4e4a43;display:grid;place-items:center;flex:0 0 auto"><i data-lucide="calendar"></i></span>
<span><span style="display:block;font-size:40px;font-weight:700;letter-spacing:-.02em">26d</span><span style="display:block;font-size:24px;color:#6a655c">Until exam day</span></span>
</div>
</div>
<div style="display:flex;flex-direction:column;gap:14px">
<div style="display:flex;gap:22px;align-items:center;padding:20px 28px;border:2px solid #efece7;border-radius:10px;background:#fff">
<span style="width:48px;height:48px;border-radius:999px;background:#12a150;color:#fff;display:grid;place-items:center;font-size:24px;font-weight:700;flex:0 0 auto">&#10003;</span>
