<section data-label="Iconography" data-screen-label="28" data-speaker-notes="Iconography is a gap I want to name rather than paper over. No Whizlabs icon set was supplied, so this is Lucide standing in — matched on stroke weight and geometry, and routed through a single component. That last detail is the important one: when you send the real set, it swaps in behind that component and every screen updates at once. Nobody hunts down individual icons. Also, no emoji anywhere, deliberately." style="display:flex;flex-direction:column;padding:100px 100px 80px;background:#f9f7f4;font-family:Poppins,sans-serif;color:#1a1917">
